<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-094" chapter-id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu" source-id="s-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu-ws2195835">
  <p id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu:p001:m0000" ref="h9n_acw_xpo_A">戴法興</persName>，會稽山陰人也。家貧，父<persName id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu:p001:m0015" ref="h9n_acw_xpo">碩子</persName>，販紵為業。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">魯郡<persName id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu:p002:m0002" ref="tad_1ld_juh">巢尚之</persName>，人士之末</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-094-dai-family-and-chao-xu:p003:m0000" ref="ath_63x_rt3">戴明寶</persName>，南東海丹徒人也。</p>
</text>
